\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Performance of different models on various metrics, after applying techniques to address class imbalance. The cost-sensitive evaluation framework reveals that while some models may have similar AUC-ROC scores, their practical utility in reducing HRRP penalties can differ significantly based on their ability to capture minority class instances.}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:metrics}{{2}{3}{Performance of different models on various metrics, after applying techniques to address class imbalance. The cost-sensitive evaluation framework reveals that while some models may have similar AUC-ROC scores, their practical utility in reducing HRRP penalties can differ significantly based on their ability to capture minority class instances}{figure.2}{}}
